    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 98 Inis Orga is presented to the market by Bowe Property as a fantastic three-bedroom, semi-detached property by the entrance to the estate with private walls, rear south-west-facing gardens enjoying a mixed residential and open countryside view. The property is flawlessly presented with accommodation consisting of three fine bedrooms, master en-suite together with a family bathroom and guest W.C., lounge and fully fitted kitchen/dining room, all seamlessly connected by an entrance and overhead landing area with airing cupboard and folding stairs to attic. The property is in turn-key condition and will lend itself as an ideal starter or retirement home and, given the property's fine location within walking distance of Bandon town and all of its amenities, an interesting investment opportunity. The property has gas-fired central heating, wooden floor, ceramic tiling, premium appliances, solid fuel stove, double-glazed windows and much, much more. The property is within walking distance of Bandon town, its schools, amenities, shops, cafes, with excellent transport links to Cork City, a mere 32km away.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nViewings are now openly invited and highly recommended. Book your viewing now to avoid disappointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.58m x 1.96m\r\nStairs to over head accommodation. Access to lounge, kitchen/dining room & guest w.c., Ceramic tiled floors. Radiator\r\n\r\n\r\nGuest W.C. - 1.51m x 1.50m\r\nFully fitted with w.c. & wash-hand basin with ceramic tiled splash back. Ceramic tiled floor. Mechanical extractor. Window onto side. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nFront Lounge - 5.01m x 3.56m \r\nFitted with raised stove fire with feature stone hearth. Bay window onto front drive. Wooden floors. T.V. point. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room - 5.62m x 3.01m\r\nFully fitted with presses & cupboards incorporating a interrogatable washing machine, double electric oven, grill, ceramic hob, suspended glass & stainless steel extractor. Integrated dishwasher. Side by side American style fridge/freezer. Ceramic style splash back & floor. Window onto rear gardens. Double doors onto rear gardens. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.08m x 2.02m\r\nAccess to bedrooms, bathroom & airing cupboard. Window to side.  Wooden floor. Folding stairs to attic. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.04m x 1.87m\r\nFitted with bathtub with over head Tridon electric shower with glazed shower screen. Fitted with w.c. & wash-hand basin. Heated chrome towel rad. Feature ceramic tiled wall. Mechanical extractor. Window to rear. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.21m x 2.56m\r\nWooden floor. Window to rear gardens. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 3.65m x 3.04\r\nBuilt in robes. Wooden floor. Window to front. T.V. point. Telephone point. Radiator. \r\nEn-suite (2.90m x 2.05m)\r\nFitted with Mira electric shower. Bifold glazed shower door. W.c. & wash-hand basin. Ceramic tiled walls & floors. Mechanical extractor. Radiator \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.76m x 2.19m\r\nBuilt in single bed base. Wooden floor. Window to front. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures & Services\r\n-Gas fired heating\r\n-Mains water\r\n- Mains drainage\r\n\r\n\r\nBER Rating: B"
      },
